# Hisbah Smart Shop — API v1 authentication contract (US-0106 contract freeze, 2026-10-13)
#
# Source of truth for the Flutter session (US-0205, US-1304) and the design state matrix (US-1505).
# Error codes: see error-codes.md. Responses below were captured from the real local API.
# Runs in VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client. Use a disposable local database only.

@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
@email = owner@demo.test
@password = password123

### 1. Login — 200
# Response:
# {
#   "message": "تم تسجيل دخولك بنجاح",
#   "user": {
#     "id": 1, "name": "Demo Owner", "email": "owner@demo.test",
#     "role": "owner",                     // owner | manager | employee
#     "status": "active",                  // active | inactive
#     "store_id": 1, "deactivated_at": null,
#     "created_at": "…", "updated_at": "…",
#     "store": { "id": 1, "name": "Demo Shop", "phone": null, "address": null,
#                "timezone": "Asia/Gaza", "created_at": "…", "updated_at": "…" }
#   },
#   "token": "<sanctum token, expires after 30 days>",
#   "meta": { "currency": "ILS" }
# }
# @name login
POST {{base}}/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### 2. Current user — 200 { "user": {…same shape as login…}, "meta": {…} }
GET {{base}}/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Logout — 200 { "message": "تم تسجيل الخروج بنجاح", "meta": {…} }
# Revokes only the current token. The same token then gets 401 UNAUTHENTICATED.
POST {{base}}/logout
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 4. Wrong password — 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
# { "message": "البيانات المدخلة غير صحيحة", "code": "INVALID_CREDENTIALS", "errors": {}, "correlation_id": "…" }
# The 6th failure for the same email + IP within 60 s returns 429 TOO_MANY_REQUESTS
# with header Retry-After: <seconds> and errors.retry_after = [<seconds>].
POST {{base}}/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "wrong-password" }

### 5. Missing fields — 422 VALIDATION_FAILED
# { "message": "The email field is required.", "code": "VALIDATION_FAILED",
#   "errors": { "email": ["The email field is required."], "password": ["The password field is required."] }, … }
# Messages are English until DEF-19 is fixed; clients show their own Arabic validation text.
POST {{base}}/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6. No / expired / revoked token — 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
# { "message": "يجب تسجيل الدخول للمتابعة.", "code": "UNAUTHENTICATED", "errors": {}, "correlation_id": "…" }
GET {{base}}/me
Accept: application/json

### 7. Deactivated user
# POST /login with the correct password → 403 USER_INACTIVE (no token issued).
# Any authenticated call with a token issued before deactivation → 403 USER_INACTIVE,
# and that token is revoked (the next call gets 401 UNAUTHENTICATED).
# { "message": "تم إيقاف هذا الحساب. تواصل مع صاحب المتجر.", "code": "USER_INACTIVE", "errors": {}, … }

### 8. Old prefix is gone — 404 (no /api/* route outside /api/v1)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{}
